    "type": "message",
    "user": "U08CR7HUWDC",
    "text": "hey \u003c@U0BTUQGHDDF\u003e,\nThe sync failed because the MySQL connection dropped while OLake was reading table column info (`invalid connection` on `tbl_orders_franchise_commission`), which stopped CDC. Please check why the connection is being closed on your side (MySQL `wait_timeout` or a proxy/load balancer idle timeout), and upgrade to v0.12.3, which stops re-fetching table metadata on every `DROP TEMPORARY TABLE` .",
    "ts": "1792655819.090569",
    "thread_ts": "1792655056.277599",
    "parent_user_id": "U0BTUQGHDDF",
    "team": "T0820LGJGRF",
